{"4725140": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "System Grid Crusher ", "steam_appid": 4725140, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SYSTEM GRID CRUSHER</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Isometric cyberpunk survival.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're in a neon rift — a grid where digital waste wants to erase you into pixels. Your weapon fires on its own, the horde pushes in from every side, and you decide just one thing: what kind of chaos to build into your loadout to survive 30:00.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4725140/extras/23d85e2da368830a45bbf04582cf6e39.apng?t=1787349974\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4725140/extras/23d85e2da368830a45bbf04582cf6e39.poster.avif?t=1787349974\" class=\"bb_img\" width=920 height=180 /></picture></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4725140/extras/0f4e93f78c7d433cacd6ef21f3e508a0.poster.avif?t=1787349974\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4725140/extras/0f4e93f78c7d433cacd6ef21f3e508a0.webm?t=1787349974\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4725140/extras/0f4e93f78c7d433cacd6ef21f3e508a0.mp4?t=1787349974\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gore, flashes, and crits. The horde rushes you on its own — don't blink.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4725140/extras/03180ae42be92911c01c1f5b1f070cc7.apng?t=1787349974\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4725140/extras/03180ae42be92911c01c1f5b1f070cc7.poster.avif?t=1787349974\" class=\"bb_img\" width=920 height=180 /></picture></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4725140/extras/da6c19b4ac717e4665a0b3550e649933.poster.avif?t=1787349974\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4725140/extras/da6c19b4ac717e4665a0b3550e649933.webm?t=1787349974\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4725140/extras/da6c19b4ac717e4665a0b3550e649933.mp4?t=1787349974\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Three cards. One level. Pick the card that suits you and get a unique combo.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4725140/extras/aa386dc3a9ae2913ffeffa9cd8b187c2.apng?t=1787349974\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4725140/extras/aa386dc3a9ae2913ffeffa9cd8b187c2.poster.avif?t=1787349974\" class=\"bb_img\" width=920 height=180 /></picture></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4725140/extras/745495a113228aa926e6e97e0aaa1e0f.poster.avif?t=1787349974\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4725140/extras/745495a113228aa926e6e97e0aaa1e0f.webm?t=1787349974\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4725140/extras/745495a113228aa926e6e97e0aaa1e0f.mp4?t=1787349974\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hit space, and a ghost runs your trail. Two of you — double the pain for the grid.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4725140/extras/027b0a0b4314122c2b0f81980ffec20f.apng?t=1787349974\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4725140/extras/027b0a0b4314122c2b0f81980ffec20f.poster.avif?t=1787349974\" class=\"bb_img\" width=920 height=180 /></picture></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4725140/extras/5ce1a53f1f046648cc3cd5c80f825071.poster.avif?t=1787349974\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4725140/extras/5ce1a53f1f046648cc3cd5c80f825071.webm?t=1787349974\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4725140/extras/5ce1a53f1f046648cc3cd5c80f825071.mp4?t=1787349974\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Coins into permanent upgrades. Today you buy damage, tomorrow you pump HP, and the day after?.. If only you live that long..</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4725140/extras/2bb47db189f8475d99ccfb6c3d25cafd.apng?t=1787349974\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4725140/extras/2bb47db189f8475d99ccfb6c3d25cafd.poster.avif?t=1787349974\" class=\"bb_img\" width=920 height=180 /></picture></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4725140/extras/a7c4f5e22064367d1488bec4e8731ade.poster.avif?t=1787349974\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4725140/extras/a7c4f5e22064367d1488bec4e8731ade.webm?t=1787349974\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4725140/extras/a7c4f5e22064367d1488bec4e8731ade.mp4?t=1787349974\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The timer ticks. The waves get thicker. Survive to 30:00, and you've Won?..</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SYSTEM GRID CRUSHER</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Isometric cyberpunk survival.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're in a neon rift — a grid where digital waste wants to erase you into pixels. Your weapon fires on its own, the horde pushes in from every side, and you decide just one thing: what kind of chaos to build into your loadout to survive 30:00.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4725140/extras/23d85e2da368830a45bbf04582cf6e39.apng?t=1787349974\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4725140/extras/23d85e2da368830a45bbf04582cf6e39.poster.avif?t=1787349974\" class=\"bb_img\" width=920 height=180 /></picture></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4725140/extras/0f4e93f78c7d433cacd6ef21f3e508a0.poster.avif?t=1787349974\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4725140/extras/0f4e93