fter?.. If only you live that long..</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4725140/extras/2bb47db189f8475d99ccfb6c3d25cafd.apng?t=1787349974\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4725140/extras/2bb47db189f8475d99ccfb6c3d25cafd.poster.avif?t=1787349974\" class=\"bb_img\" width=920 height=180 /></picture></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4725140/extras/a7c4f5e22064367d1488bec4e8731ade.poster.avif?t=1787349974\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4725140/extras/a7c4f5e22064367d1488bec4e8731ade.webm?t=1787349974\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4725140/extras/a7c4f5e22064367d1488bec4e8731ade.mp4?t=1787349974\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The timer ticks. The waves get thicker. Survive to 30:00, and you've Won?..</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "System Grid Crusher is an isometric cyberpunk survival game set in a neon rift: the horde presses in, your weapon fires on its own, and you collect power-ups and build your loadout longer than anyone else. So, are we stacking single-target damage or going full AoE?", "supported_languages": "English, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Vietnamese, Simplified Chinese, Korean, Polish, Portuguese - Brazil, Portuguese - Portugal, Romanian, Russian, Thai, Turkish, Czech, Swedish, Japanese", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4725140/19ab7ee5a16a5698e41b52d510c9e62e6ddc0751/header.jpg?t=1787349974", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akam